# PixelPlus release signing keys (minisign / Ed25519), one public key per line
# (the "RW…" line of `minisign -G`'s .pub file). Compiled into pixelplusd and
# installed to /usr/share/pixelplus/keys/ by the package; both the daemon and the
# root helper refuse updates not signed by one of these keys.
#
# The project's key is generated by the maintainer (docs/BUILDING.md, "Signed
# updates") and its secret half lives only in the release workflow's secrets.
# Until a key is listed here, over-the-air updates are disabled in this build
# (the apt repository path still works).
#
# To rotate: add the new key here and ship a release signed with the OLD key,
# then sign with the new one; remove the old key a release later.
